sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant K as Kite (WebSocket)
    participant S as Server
    participant U as Screens
    K--xS: connection drops
    S->>S: reconnect: 1 s, 2 s, 4 s … up to 30 s · resubscribe
    U->>U: no price for 5 s → band PRICES n s OLD
    S->>U: after a minute: alert "No prices" (and the phone webhook)
    Note over U: working orders at the exchange are unaffected<br/>don't click stale ladder prices
    K-->>S: connected again
    S->>K: resubscribe the watched instruments
    S->>K: order book → reconcile (updates missed while away)
    S->>U: prices flow · the band and the alert clear
    Note over S,K: Kite says "logged out" → retrying stops: log in to Kite again
